From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 11:16:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 85/85] fix(curiosity): the day's question is spent only when
 it is handed on (3500)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 50760, seat 182562: the first run's queue build passed its 6 s budget,
the run went without the day's question, and the abandoned build logged
its item as surfaced 61 s later — which spent the day's one question on a
question nobody was shown, so neither run asked it. The day's path now
builds without logging and logs the one item it actually hands on; the
tool and connector paths log as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
